  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Server Entry Point**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the server entry point, `/server.ts`. I need to define the REST API endpoints this file will provide. Specifically, I\'m thinking about two crucial endpoints: a POST route for running a baseline simulation, allowing either the 25 district selections or custom parameters, and another POST route to handle scenario simulations.\n\n\n**Expanding API Endpoints**\n\nNow, I\'m fleshing out several more API endpoints. I\'m adding routes for calibration against time series data (`/api/simulation/calibrate`), district indicator retrieval (`/api/districts`), and various validation methods like Kolmogorov-Smirnov, Sobol, bootstrap resampling, and external validation against benchmarks. I\'m also including Gemini API endpoints for a public health policy copilot (`/api/gemini/chat`) and image analysis (`/api/gemini/analyze-image`). Finally, I need to configure Vite middleware for dev and static file serving for prod. I\'m thinking of binding to 0.0.0.0 and port 3000.\n\n\n"
