  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Translation Framework**\n\nI\'m working on the architecture for a translation system. The goal is a comprehensive dictionary and a context/hook provider within `src/i18n/`. It\'ll store English and Spanish translations, with Spanish as the default. Now I\'m focused on how to make the dictionary structure and hook most extensible, so we don\'t need to rebuild it every time.\n\n\n**Enumerating Keys & Context**\n\nI\'ve made progress in mapping all the translation keys, encompassing UI elements across the entire application: navbar, tabs, views (dashboard, causal loop, scenarios, equity, validation, reports, AI copilot, code architecture), and the footer. Next, I\'m setting up a `LanguageContext` so we can easily switch languages. It will provide the `language`, `setLanguage`, and `t` functions for easy use.\n\n\n"
