    thinking: "**Analyzing Implementation Details**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the implementation details for the first requirement. I\'m going to add a scale toggle within the `DashboardView.tsx` component. The scale mode will be `\'amplified\'`, utilizing dual-axis multipliers with explicit badges, specifically S2, as part of the visual representation.\n\n\n**Expanding Equity Calculations**\n\nI\'m now extending the `equityDisaggregation` type in `src/types.ts` to include fiscal cost analysis per quintile. I\'m calculating the `fiscalCostUSD` for each quintile, factoring in the progressive equity weight. I\'m computing `costPerLifeSavedInQ` and `benefitCostRatio` in `src/services/systemDynamics.ts`. My next step is to display the complete Fiscal Budget Breakdown in `src/components/EquityView.tsx`.\n\n\n**Implementing Monte Carlo Panel**\n\nI\'m working on the `ValidationView.tsx` component, integrating an interactive Monte Carlo panel. It will have an iteration selector and a button to trigger an asynchronous batch execution via API. The panel will include a live progress bar, displaying ETA, throughput, a streaming histogram, and an API status indicator.\n\n\n"
