MMR:  224 | Red:  42.3% | Lives Saved:   122Mbarara District       | Base MMR:  457 (Obs: 375) | Scen D MMR:  225 | Red:    40% | Lives Saved:   103Tamale Metro & Sagnarigu | Base MMR:  500 (Obs: 420) | Scen D MMR:  266 | Red:  36.7% | Lives Saved:   123Bolgatanga & Bongo     | Base MMR:  527 (Obs: 448) | Scen D MMR:  243 | Red:  45.8% | Lives Saved:   108Ho Municipal & Central | Base MMR:  440 (Obs: 355) | Scen D MMR:  262 | Red:  26.2% | Lives Saved:    40Kumasi Metro           | Base MMR:  439 (Obs: 295) | Scen D MMR:  454 | Red: -53.9% | Lives Saved:     0Greater Accra East     | Base MMR:  463 (Obs: 260) | Scen D MMR:  565 | Red: -117.3% | Lives Saved:     0Jigjiga Zone & Godey   | Base MMR:  735 (Obs: 685) | Scen D MMR:  267 | Red:    61% | Lives Saved:   624Awash & Semera Zone    | Base MMR:  762 (Obs: 710) | Scen D MMR:  274 | Red:  61.4% | Lives Saved:   364East Shewa (Adama)     | Base MMR:  487 (Obs: 430) | Scen D MMR:  163 | Red:  62.1% | Lives Saved:   577West Gojjam (Bahir Dar) | Base MMR:  511 (Obs: 455) | Scen D MMR:  162 | Red:  64.4% | Lives Saved:   561Central Tigray (Mekelle) | Base MMR:  541 (Obs: 490) | Scen D MMR:  175 | Red:  64.3% | Lives Saved:   345"
