Base MMR:  390 (Obs: 388) | Scen D MMR:  142 | Red:  63.4% | Lives Saved:   183Mbarara District          | Base MMR:  377 (Obs: 375) | Scen D MMR:  144 | Red:  61.6% | Lives Saved:   158Tamale Metro & Sagnarigu  | Base MMR:  422 (Obs: 420) | Scen D MMR:  161 | Red:  61.7% | Lives Saved:   206Bolgatanga & Bongo        | Base MMR:  450 (Obs: 448) | Scen D MMR:  165 | Red:  63.2% | Lives Saved:   149Ho Municipal & Central    | Base MMR:  357 (Obs: 355) | Scen D MMR:  149 | Red:    58% | Lives Saved:    88Kumasi Metro              | Base MMR:  298 (Obs: 295) | Scen D MMR:  171 | Red:    42% | Lives Saved:   397Greater Accra East        | Base MMR:  263 (Obs: 260) | Scen D MMR:  173 | Red:  33.5% | Lives Saved:   324Jigjiga Zone & Godey      | Base MMR:  686 (Obs: 685) | Scen D MMR:  255 | Red:  62.8% | Lives Saved:   642Awash & Semera Zone       | Base MMR:  711 (Obs: 710) | Scen D MMR:  261 | Red:  63.2% | Lives Saved:   375East Shewa (Adama)        | Base MMR:  431 (Obs: 430) | Scen D MMR:  120 | Red:  72.1% | Lives Saved:   671West Gojjam (Bahir Dar)   | Base MMR:  456 (Obs: 455) | Scen D MMR:  129 | Red:  71.6% | Lives Saved:   624Central Tigray (Mekelle)  | Base MMR:  491 (Obs: 490) | Scen D MMR:  149 | Red:  69.6% | Lives Saved:   373"
